Abalone framework
-----------------

The engine is built on the Abalone framework by Josef Weidendorfer: the board,
move generation, evaluation, search interface, network bus and the player,
referee and start programs in src/framework/. The search strategies, the
transposition table, the measurement driver, the timed engine, the tests and
the studies are covered by the MIT license above.

The files in src/framework/ are Copyright (c) 1997-2015 Josef Weidendorfer and
are not covered by the MIT license above. They keep their original notices.
player.cpp, referee.cpp and start.cpp are licensed under the GNU General Public
License, version 2 or later, as their headers state. The framework descends
from Kenolaba, which Weidendorfer publishes under the GPL-2.0 as Qenolaba.
Changes made to board.h, eval.h, eval.cpp and player.cpp are marked in their
headers.
